<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Règlement - Urgence Lilloise</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0a0a0c;
      color: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px 10% 40px 10%;
    }

    /* HEADER & LOGO */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 0;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a22;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .logo img {
      height: 45px;
      width: auto;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #e52d48;
    }

    .btn-back {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background-color: #121218;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-back:hover {
      background-color: #1a1a22;
      border-color: #e52d48;
    }

    /* CONTENU */
    .sub-title {
      color: #e52d48;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .sub-title::before {
      content: '— ';
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .description {
      color: #a0a0a0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* ENCADRÉ D'ACCEPTATION AUTOMATIQUE */
    .acceptance-notice {
      background: rgba(229, 45, 72, 0.1);
      border-left: 4px solid #e52d48;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .acceptance-notice i {
      color: #e52d48;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .accordion-container {
      border: 1px solid #222;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #0e0e12;
    }

    details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a22;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    details:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    details[open] {
      background-color: #121218;
    }

    summary {
      list-style: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    .acc-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .acc-num {
      color: #e52d48;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      min-width: 25px;
    }

    .acc-content {
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    .acc-content p {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .acc-content ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .acc-content ul li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .acc-content ul li::before {
      content: '•';
      color: #e52d48;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .subtitle-block {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .plus-icon {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .sanction-box {
      background: rgba(229, 45, 72, 0.1);
      border-left: 3px solid #e52d48;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ff6b81;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HEADER AVEC LOGO ET BOUTON RETOUR -->
  <header>
    <a href="/" class="logo">
      <img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1490687935509430293/1529274485063028807/logo.png?ex=6a615759&is=6a6005d9&hm=097142531e6bc6a87627bc785c57bfbceae7245f06f4d118411ee0c3c3c9bf23&=&format=webp&quality=lossless" alt="Logo Urgence Lilloise">
      Urgence Lilloise <span>Semi FivePD</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/" class="btn-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Accueil</a>
  </header>

  <div class="sub-title">À lire attentivement</div>
  <h1>Règlement Officiel</h1>
  <p class="description">Le respect de ces règles est obligatoire pour garantir une expérience Roleplay de qualité sur Urgence Lilloise.</p>

  <!-- ENCADRÉ D'AVERTISSEMENT -->
  <div class="acceptance-notice">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
    <span>En rejoignant le serveur Urgence Lilloise, vous acceptez automatiquement l'intégralité de ce règlement.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="accordion-container">

    <!-- 1. Règlement Général -->
    <details>
      <summary>
        <div class="acc-title">
          <span class="acc-num">01</span>
          <span>Règlement Général</span>
